### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "change-this-password",
  "roles": ["UNIVERSITY_STUDENT"],
  "interests": ["Computer Science"],
  "goals": ["Structured learning"]
}

### Login (replace values)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "change-this-password"
}

### Profile (paste access token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### List workspaces
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Create workspace
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Research",
  "type": "RESEARCH"
}
